'''Queen Ants''' are a [[Mob]] that can be found in {{Zone|Ant's Cave}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Queen Ants''' have a {{Chance|2.5%|1|40}} chance to spawn per each {{MobSprite|Ant}} when breaking an [[Anthill]] in {{Zone|Ant's Cave}}. The chance to spawn can be increased with {{stat|Tracking}}.<ref>{{Cite Discord|staff=y|url=https://discord.com/channels/651912910972649492/1529181650641228007/1534715197116125195|user=mrkeith|date=8/5/26, 7:10 PM (EST)|text=Base 2.5% * Queen Tracker attribute bonus per ant roll}}</ref>

== Behavior ==
'''Queen Ants''' can only be damaged with a [[Vacuum]] due to being a {{mt|Pest}}. Until all of the {{MobSprite|Ant}}s that spawned with the '''Queen Ant are killed''', the '''Queen''' '''Ant''' remains immune to damage.

